    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in dystopian city controlled by a violent police, a kid must answer the call to help his people. Beware of the lights, they hide danger. Keep in the shadows and avoid encounters with the plicemen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788260/extras/0bdddc1bbe5b7dcd24d333966847098c.avif?t=1752939588\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Firecracker, many posibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your only tool to distract enemies disable traps and escape danger.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sthealt and evation are your weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide, jump and evade way through a city full of threats. A relentless police officer won't let you pass, stay out of sight or use distractions to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Side Scroller with reactive enemy traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique light-based enemies:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights that shoot projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights that summon speeding cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights that follow you and trigger a giant cannon</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect items for the citizens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather key objects scattered around the city to unlock new areas. Each item brings you closer to fulfill your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in dystopian city controlled by a violent police, a kid must answer the call to help his people. Beware of the lights, they hide danger. Keep in the shadows and avoid encounters with the plicemen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788260/extras/0bdddc1bbe5b7dcd24d333966847098c.avif?t=1752939588\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Firecracker, many posibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your only tool to distract enemies disable traps and escape danger.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sthealt and evation are your weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide, jump and evade way through a city full of threats. A relentless police officer won't let you pass, stay out of sight or use distractions to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Side Scroller with reactive enemy traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique light-based enemies:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights that shoot projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights that summon speeding cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights that follow you and trigger a giant cannon</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect items for the citizens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather key objects scattered around the city to unlock new areas. Each item brings you closer to fulfill your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Hurdle dangerous obstacles in this dystopian 2.5D platformer set at night in a controlled city. Is your duty to collect all the items and advance to other city locations. Bur after, dodge the guards that are patrolling the city.",
